    "我们会尽力使用系统提供的安全机制保护你的数据，但任何电子存储和传输方式都无法做到绝对安全。请妥善保管设备和备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We make reasonable efforts to protect your data using system-provided security mechanisms, but no electronic storage or transmission method is completely secure. Please protect your device and backups."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
